# Seasoned Cryomancer: the first discards a second Seasoned Cryomancer and an Island; the one nonland card triggers the
# reflexive ability, whose one target Bot1 declines ("up to"). On turn 3 Bot1 has {3}{U}{U}: the ability is not
# offered by the Cryomancer on the battlefield (it works only from the graveyard), and the one in the graveyard is
# exiled to draw two cards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
